      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The author, after presenting diagnostic criteria and interpretations of the 4-sec. rhythm in the brain potential record, describes a case where this symptom is localized in the right occipital region. He also points out that further elucidation should be possible by a differential establishment of indications."},
